# The path-traced reference (5 bounces, sun, sky and lamps; shader/lighting/pt/pathtrace.frag) of the gi-clips
# views: the same shots, accumulated while the camera holds still. The hero, NPC and grass are not in the ray
# scene, so they are missing from it. Run with rays on and no GI, the window of gi-clips:
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=0 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-reference
# Made from gi-clips.bench: shots get 12 s to accumulate, a clip becomes a 2 s wait (a path-traced shot is
# written a few slow frames later: the next goto must not come first). Change both together.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
toggle pathtrace

# 1. The candle- and torch-lit harbour house of perf-interior at night (views 2 and 3: the hearth, the shelves):
#    fire light bounces off the walls, the corners away from it stay dark, no sky comes in; a slow pan.
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 90
wait 10000
cam hold
wait 12000
shot interior-night-1
wait 3000
cam world 160 170 180
wait 300
cam hold
wait 12000
shot interior-night-2
wait 2000

# 2. A plank hut of the harbour's poor quarter: thin walls (light leaks), the sun through the gaps and the door at
#    noon, at night the dark.
set time 12 0
