clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 180 170 0
wait 10000
cam hold
wait 12000
shot hut-day-1
wait 3000
cam world 180 170 180
wait 300
cam hold
wait 12000
shot hut-day-2
wait 1000
set time 23 0
wait 3000
cam world 180 170 0
wait 300
cam hold
wait 12000
shot hut-night-1
wait 1000

